    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6274" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβολ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>filled by a machine,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάκκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					1695.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(vi A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>delayed, deferred,</i> of payments, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				669.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A. D.)</span>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τὁ,</span>
			<i>deferment of payments,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PAmh.
				2.131
			</span></i>; but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίνον ἀ.,</span> perh.
				= linen <i>for cloaks, PThead.Inv.</i><i><span class="en">
				15
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναβλητικῶς</span>
			 (q. v.), <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1241.38
			</span></i>.</div>
